msgid "Singly Linked List"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/linked_list.rst:26
#: f029843906c14489a195294d7ab57f96
msgid ""
"In a **singly linked list**, each node contains data and a reference to "
"the **next** node in the sequence. Traversal is unidirectional (forward "
"only)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/linked_list.rst:41
#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/linked_list.rst:70
