msgid "Doubly Linked List"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/linked_list.rst:52
#: 2910a3a90bc145b58694b1ca0ae035b0
msgid ""
"In a **doubly linked list**, each node contains data and references to "
"both the **next** and **previous** nodes. This enables bidirectional "
"traversal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/linked_list.rst:72
#: 821c876bf4ec40938cd271eb14e250f0
msgid "**Bidirectional**: Can traverse forward and backward"
